1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,666
We have established Lina's jurisdiction,
but what is the actual issue?

2
00:00:09,708 --> 00:00:12,348
Lina stopped showing up for work six weeks
ago.

3
00:00:14,283 --> 00:00:17,163
Her manager sent your colleague Roshan a
WhatsApp message.

4
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:23,349
What should you and Roshan do? Before HR
can even decide what process to follow,

5
00:00:23,349 --> 00:00:27,291
they confirm which entity employs Lina and
which rules apply.

